  "canonical_source": "wrl 0.1\ntier G1\nstimulus_unit 1\nstate s0 : 1 = 0e0\nparam p0 : 1 in [0e0, 4e0] trainable bits 8\nparam p1 : s in [1e-1, 2e0] trainable bits 8\nlet n0 = state(s0)\nlet n1 = sum_in(s0, exc)\nlet n2 = stimulus()\nlet n3 = type_mask(x)\nlet n4 = 2.5e-1[1]\nlet n5 = delay(s0, 2)\nlet n6 = mul(n4, n5)\nlet n7 = sum_in(s0, inh)\nlet n8 = neg(n7)\nlet n9 = add(n1, n2, n3, n6, n8)\nlet n10 = tanh(n9)\nlet n11 = param(p1)\nlet n12 = leaky_integrate(n0, n10, n11)\nnext s0 = n12\ngap s0 scale p0\nobserve calcium_linear_v1(s0, p1)\n"
